<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίν-τονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bent backward</i>, i.e.
			the opposite way to that in which they were drawn, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξα</span>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> of the bow whether strung, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.266
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.443
			</span></i>; or unstrung, <i><span class="en">
				10.459
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				511
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀράβιοι τόξα π. εἶχον μακρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.69
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκυθικὰ π. βέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					161
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>back-stretched</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡνίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				1739
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>caused by opposite tensions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἁρμονίη κόσμου ὅκωσπερ λύρης καὶ
					τόξου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					51
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίντροπος</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίντονα, τά</span>, <i>military engines for throwing stones</i>,
			but not pointed missiles, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθοβόλα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				91.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				104
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
